  end on

  on the player touching
    refuse portrait-too-high
  end on

  on the player pushing
    refuse portrait-too-high
  end on

  on the player pulling
    refuse portrait-too-high
  end on

  on the player climbing
    refuse portrait-too-high
  end on

define phrase shannon-his-eyes
  'His eyes...' whispers Shannon, with a slight catch in her throat.
  'Jacqueline, dear, you have his eyes.'
end phrase

define phrase portrait-too-high
  The portrait is hung too high for you to reach.
end phrase

