## The furnace: a closed container, cold until the wood goes in; its
## description reads by open/closed and cold/hot as four refusals (a marker
## in an entity description prints literally, GH #364).

create the furnace
  aka boiler, iron furnace, pot-bellied furnace, grate, grating, metal grating, pipes, pipe, heater, iron stove
  a container, openable
  in the Cellar
  states, reversible: cold, hot

  The metal grating is closed.

  on the player examining
    refuse when the furnace is hot and the furnace is closed: furnace-hot-closed
    refuse when the furnace is hot: furnace-hot-open
    refuse when the furnace is open: furnace-cold-open
  end on

  after the player opening
    first time
      phrase grating-squeaks-open
      phrase shannon-use-the-broken-wood when the player has the pile of broken wood
      phrase shannon-break-up-furniture when not the player has the pile of broken wood
  end after

  on the player touching
    refuse when the furnace is hot: furnace-snatch-hand
    refuse furnace-metal-cold
  end on

define phrase furnace-cold, stopping while the furnace is cold
  Against the back wall stands a pot-bellied iron furnace, cold and still.
end phrase

define phrase furnace-hot, stopping while the furnace is hot
  Against the back wall stands a pot-bellied iron furnace, giving off a
  bright orange glow.
end phrase

define phrase furnace-cold-open
  The metal grating is open, and the interior is dark.
end phrase

define phrase furnace-hot-closed
  The furnace is closed, but bright orange light flickers through the
  grating. Thick, metal pipes leading away from the furnace carry the heat
  to other parts of the house.
end phrase

define phrase furnace-hot-open
  The furnace is open, and bright orange light pours out from it. Thick,
  metal pipes leading away from the furnace carry the heat to other parts of
  the house.
end phrase

define phrase grating-squeaks-open
  The grating squeaks open. The inside of the furnace is empty and dark.
end phrase

