define phrase rags-never-again
  Now that you're finally clean, you don't think you could bear to put those
  filthy rags on again.
end phrase

define phrase dont-touch-the-rags
  Now that you're finally clean, you don't want anything to do with those
  filthy rags. You don't even want to touch them.
end phrase

